<view class="page" wx:if="{{record}}"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="heading">每种配料，<view>分开看明白</view></view><text class="small">{{record.kind}} · {{count}} 项配料</text></view><image class="logo" src="/assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view wx:if="{{allergens}}" class="allergen-alert"><view style="font-weight:600">优先核对：{{allergens}}</view><view>仅从原文名称提示部分过敏原线索，不是完整过敏原检测。请核对实物完整标签及交叉接触提示。</view></view><view class="note">当前未提供添加量和营养成分表，无法评估这包食品的具体营养贡献或风险程度。不做商品安全评级，配料顺序不等于实际添加量。</view><view class="section"><text class="subtitle">配料作用与风险</text><text class="small">按常见作用分组</text></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="tabs"><view class="tab {{filter === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="filter">{{item.name}}</view></scroll-view><block wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="group"><view class="group" wx:if="{{group.rows.length && (filter === 'all' || filter === group.id)}}"><view class="group-head">{{group.title}}<text class="small">{{group.rows.length}} 项</text></view><view class="column"><text>配料名称</text><text>作用、好处与注意事项</text></view><view class="ingredient" wx:for="{{group.rows}}" wx:key="id"><view class="name wrap"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text class="tag">{{item.role}}</text></view><view class="explanation"><text class="field">{{item.group === 'pending' ? '待解析' : '作用与好处'}}</text><view>{{item.benefit}}</view><view class="risk"><text class="field">注意与风险</text><view>{{item.risk}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.url}}" class="link" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="source">依据：{{item.source}} ↗<view class="small">点按复制资料链接</view></view></view></view></view></block><view class="card" bindtap="toggle"><text style="font-weight:600">{{original ? '收起' : '查看'}}包装原文与资料说明 {{original ? '−' : '+'}}</text><view wx:if="{{original}}"><view class="wrap" style="margin:20rpx 0" selectable>{{record.raw}}</view><view class="small">信息依据交付原型提供的资料整理，仅供理解常见配料用途。实际影响取决于配方、剂量和个人情况。</view></view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="edit">继续添加 / 修改配料</button></view><view wx:else class="empty">{{loading ? '正在读取服务端解析…' : error || '记录不存在或已删除'}}<button wx:if="{{!loading}}" class="secondary" bindtap="onShow">重新加载</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view>
